        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TwoBrains OneShip</strong> is a chaotic co-op space adventure where two players share one single spaceship — and its entire control system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: deliver a crucial package from station to station across the galaxy to stop a chain reaction that could destroy the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy? Think again. Hostile ships, deadly asteroid fields, and a rage-inducing control scheme are all waiting to turn your ship into stardust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together (or try to), survive the madness, and earn credits to upgrade your ship for future runs. Every successful delivery brings you one step closer to saving the galaxy — or losing your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic 2-player co-op with shared controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense deliveries between space stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system with meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement that tests both skill and friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against enemy ships and environmental hazards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go before the galaxy — or your friendship — explodes?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TwoBrains OneShip</strong> is a chaotic co-op space adventure where two players share one single spaceship — and its entire control system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: deliver a crucial package from station to station across the galaxy to stop a chain reaction that could destroy the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy? Think again. Hostile ships, deadly asteroid fields, and a rage-inducing control scheme are all waiting to turn your ship into stardust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together (or try to), survive the madness, and earn credits to upgrade your ship for future runs. Every successful delivery brings you one step closer to saving the galaxy — or losing your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic 2-player co-op with shared controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense deliveries between space stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system with meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement that tests both skill and friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against enemy ships and environmental hazards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go before the galaxy — or your friendship — explodes?</p>",
        "short_description": "Two players. One ship. Infinite chaos. Deliver cargo across the galaxy, upgrade your ship, and try not to explode — or each other.",
